  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-copycat-shadow-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "985c8b46d9d25aaa8bec1f39ddffd5b39ed148d5014d8c43b77637c01e202f73",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7559d991f1a57eca43d69c409b818f061c78a1744b89203c7eb43eb4a328af6e",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nCopycat Shadow",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9834db8dd4b2359b1f0929f555a6d189353b92f8012611bec34be64190740345",
      "text": "It is shadow-show night\nin the courtyard.\nSandy puts a lamp here\nand a screen over there.\n“They stay put,” he says.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4cca19bdea79d6f57da9733bc6faa8354d4cee28eaa6a85c83ad380ae1c34dde",
      "text": "Wukong steps between\nthe lamp and the screen.\nHe swishes his tail.\nA giant tail swishes\non the screen!\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11be7cb409d6d18badc87b92201a2e753c032dcd04d7e705e67647dcff87e6d6",
      "text": "“Who is that?”\nHe waves. It waves.\nHe jumps. It jumps.\n“Someone is copying me!”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "387319a76c56fa06b438637efb701b6ea82de5b84af300e93988f6b5117c8278",
      "text": "Rabbit giggles.\n“That is your shadow.\nYou block the light,\nso a dark shape\nlands on the screen.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71fef951d12e64481f03eb27838cb9d6522de6cf5d6f248fe5ae42bc8ea46907",
      "text": "Rabbit holds up\na paper monkey on a stick.\n“Watch this,” she says.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a6371029ff20502485174a7571b91fead05d21928409a6943fcb0f2d7f15c55",
      "text": "She moves the monkey\nnearer to the lamp.\nThe shadow grows\nbigger and bigger!\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "355bd012244bc7001a71d3e8aaad428a560235056317b1e180194efef525ff01",
      "text": "Then she moves it\nfarther from the lamp,\nclose to the screen.\nNow the shadow is small.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "164aee23c19d6874cf1163fe17885dd25490fcb515ab4c90e06edd2c01881103",
      "text": "Wukong tries the bunny.\nNearer the lamp:\na big bunny!\nFarther away:\na small bunny!\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5135a780cd917ed3550658f559a90a6aa4bbf5f26ff6c44ebd320368ce00bc05",
      "text": "The big monkey shadow\nmeets the little bunny.\n“After you,” says Wukong,\nand the big monkey bows.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "23ec96ca480440c8de67f679cd9b678e5936414d5550b4a3fb1c4f262ab54dff",
      "text": "Pigsy sits on a cushion.\n“Show time!” he cheers.\nSandy waves from the lamp.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "19bb913dd0bceac1b8bf50d3f9f5b3c20747198c14b334c85da23c4ac85a07f4",
      "text": "Two long ears\npop up on the screen.\n“Whose ears are these?”\nasks Rabbit.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45d58d50873fd9f7bf1accec4b24b0835a1a7face8e01d33fde5f6aa9a9e3ad5",
      "text": "“Rabbit’s!” says Pigsy.\nThen two tall ears pop up,\neven taller than before.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcd745b78614f5c69ab631c12985af87edfbcf66bae3aa877e3646a74a43ea35",
      "text": "Pigsy laughs.\n“Those are not ears!\nWukong’s fingers\nblock the light!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5afe4e38a8a968df4a742028da096ecfaaff7ebe98f19bbaf2e0ee021f8aa6eb",
      "text": "Wukong and Rabbit\nstand between\nthe lamp and the screen.\nTheir shadows wave goodbye.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72375d718ee62f24c00308946d6c8054ea849bd1b6a0da43e7b172db33042357",
      "text": "When the lamp is off,\nthe shadows are gone.\n“My copy friend\nwent home,” says Wukong.\n“He’ll be back\nwith the light!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
